### Create object
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/objects
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: demo

{
  "content_type": "application/pdf",
  "size_bytes": 12345
}

### Get object metadata + presigned download
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/objects/{{object_id}}
X-Tenant-ID: demo

### Complete object (mark complete)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/objects/{{object_id}}/complete
X-Tenant-ID: demo

### Soft delete object (mark soft_deleted)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/v1/objects/{{object_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: demo

{
  "status": "soft_deleted"
}

### Hard delete object (irreversible)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/objects/{{object_id}}
X-Tenant-ID: demo

### Initiate multipart
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/multipart
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: demo

{
  "content_type": "application/pdf",
  "size_bytes": 20000000
}

### Sign part
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/multipart/{{upload_id}}/parts/1/sign
X-Tenant-ID: demo

### Complete multipart
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/multipart/{{upload_id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: demo

{
  "parts": [
    { "part_number": 1, "etag": ""etag-from-s3"" }
  ]
}

### Abort multipart
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/multipart/{{upload_id}}/abort
X-Tenant-ID: demo
